	<div tabindex="-1" id="more">
				<div class="info-box">
			<h3>About Hockey Bros</h3>
						<p>Hockey Bros is a fast, physical, and downright chaotic online hockey game that you can play free right in your browser. No downloads, no sign-ups, just quick-fire ice hockey action. Line up your shot, throw a bone-crushing check, drop the gloves for a fight, and battle your way to the game-ending horn in this no-holds-barred hockey game!</p>
			<p>Whether you&#039;re looking for a quick game at lunch or want to grind out wins against your friends in online multiplayer, Hockey Bros delivers the mayhem. Skate circles around defenders, smash your bros into the boards, and rack up goals with a control scheme that&#039;s easy to pick up but tough to master.</p>
			<p>Controls:<br />
Move: Arrow keys or WASD<br />
Shoot / Pass / Check: Space bar</p>
