						<b>Why isn&#039;t the game loading?</b>
			<p>First, check your internet connection and confirm our site isn't being blocked by your network. Ad blockers and browser extensions can also interfere with the game so try disabling them and refreshing the page.</p>
						<b>How do I play?</b>
			<p>Use your arrow keys (or WASD) to skate around the rink, then hit the space bar to shoot, pass, or check. Get the puck past the goalie and into the net to score. The team with the most goals at the finishing buzzer wins the game.</p>
						<b>Which browser should I use?</b>
